      "writtenOn": "2025-09-03T09:03:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I appreciate the extra details here, and while helps to explain things a bit,  it still feels like this vendorhooks is inconsistently called with different locks held, which feels like is asking for trouble.\n\n\n\u003e In deed this VH hook is upstreamed by our team, i guess only our team use the hook.\n\nNot necessarily, other vendors may be using it already once the hook has landed. So we need to be cautious here.",
